  "about": "I’m a software developer with a strong focus on frontend experience, thoughtful design, and building tools that make complex work feel simpler.\n\nI enjoy working at the intersection of design, engineering, and product, turning ideas into polished, intuitive experiences while thinking beyond the immediate implementation to how a product can evolve. I care about the details users notice, the systems developers rely on, and the workflows that help teams do their best work.\n\nMore recently, I’ve been focused on how AI can become a practical part of those workflows. That includes building shared context and tooling that helps developers, designers, product managers, and producers get more value from AI, as well as exploring agentic development workflows that make engineering work more efficient without sacrificing review, quality, or ownership.\n\nI’m constantly learning, experimenting, and looking for ways to improve both the products I build and the way teams build them.",
